+// the stream-k decomposition walks the list in order, so an expert's K split points (its summation order) changed
+// from run to run: identical inputs and weights, different bytes (found on the GH200, whose prefill uses this path).
+// One block of 1024 threads does a stable ballot/prefix compaction; the list is tiny and n_experts is ~20k.
